    <sys:String xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=System.Runtime" x:Key="Loc.DatabaseProfiles.SafetyFooter">All profile tunnel tests and authenticated diagnostics use an ephemeral local forward bound to 127.0.0.1; there is no silent direct/public fallback. SQL Server uses a minimal TDS pre-login probe and authenticated diagnostics through the same loopback tunnel. There is no arbitrary query console and credentials are never displayed.</sys:String>
